t) of design #4592, for issue #4593 (task 14247).\n\n## What\n\n- States the #4592 admission contract verbatim in the pkgs/id/src/world/replication.rs module doc (new 'Admission contract (#4592)' section): a frame is admitted only if its header version names a chain that could exist — inside the restore range JOURNAL_VERSION..=MAX_JOURNAL_VERSION, and, for a snapshot, never lower than the version of the chain the tracker already holds.\n- Cross-references the contract from the ReplicationTracker::accept doc comment.\n- Documentation only; no behavior change.\n\n## Audit outcome (full inventory posted on issue #4593)\n\nEvery WorldCore::restore precondition was dispositioned against accept at origin/main 1cd22df899. Header presence/shape, header world, header version range, per-entry decodability, and payload header agreement (#4486) all hold at accept. Dispositions (b), (c), (d) confirmed with code/test evidence on issue #4593. One confirmed gap: per-entry version requirements (disposition (a)) are enforced at restore (core.rs) but not at accept — filed as follow-up issue #7970, not fixed here per the audit scope.\n\n## Tests\n\n- cargo test -p id --lib world::replication on the laptop (result recorded on issue #4593 / task 14247).\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T05:15:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T05:26:01Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T05:25:58Z","merged_at":"2026-11-09T05:25:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"b650a87b27d6696ceac3172a98d646a9f20635ed","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"developing-today:queue/14247-4593-replication-admission-audit","ref":"queue/14247-4593-replication-admission-audit","repo":{"id":627308783,"node_id":"R_kgDOJWP47w","name":"code","full_name":"developing-today/code","owner":{"login":"developing-today","id":26439447,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjI2NDM5NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"